This is a UART simulation in verilog

It consists of three main modules
1.Baud rate generator
2.Transmitter
3.Receiver

Baud generator:
Its supplied a clock of 100Mhz from top module
It generates a baud rate of 9600
It also supplies enb_rx and enc_tx to transmitter and receiver module respectivly

Transmitter
Gets data in parallel format converts it to serial format for transmission
Transmit data when enb_tx signal received from baud rate generator

Receiver
Gets data in serial format and convert it into parallet
Receives data when enb_rx signal received from baud rate generator
